{"seq":3,"slug":"key-value-form-understanding-ops","title":"表单与键值抽取实操：票据场景、人工复核与合规约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/layout-table-form-extraction/key-value-form-understanding-ops","wordCount":2899,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"表单与键值抽取实操-票据场景-人工复核与合规约束\">表单与键值抽取实操：票据场景、人工复核与合规约束</h1><p>一张跨境 B2B 商业发票要进 ERP，真正卡住流水线的从来不是「字认没认对」。OCR 之后系统还得回答：<code>Total Amount Due</code> 是哪个数、<code>Invoice No.</code> 属于哪个字段、币种为什么是 EUR 而付款方写的是 USD、以及当模型只有 0.61 置信度时这张单子该不该直接过账。键值抽取（Key-Information Extraction, KIE）就是把「一张票据图像」映射成「一组具名字段 + 各自置信度」的过程，而<strong>表单与键值抽取实操</strong>交付的是这条映射的落地：字段模式怎么定、置信度怎么分流、人工复核怎么闭环、以及哪些合规约束会反向改动字段设计。</p>\n<p>本文只覆盖从「已定位的键值对区域」到「可入账的结构化记录 + 复核工单」这一段。上游「页面怎么切成区域、阅读顺序怎么还原」见同章 <a href=\"layout-analysis-document-structure\"><code>1_layout-analysis-document-structure.md</code></a>；「表格区域怎么还原成网格」见 <a href=\"table-structure-recognition-extraction\"><code>2_table-structure-recognition-extraction.md</code></a>。票据表头字段走 KIE，表体行项目走 TSR，两条路的评测口径不同，混在一起会导致「文档准确率」虚高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-kv-抽取的任务形式与四个量\">核心概念：KV 抽取的任务形式与四个量</h2><p>KIE 的形式化很简单：给定文档图像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与字段模式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\{f_1 \\dots f_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\{(f_i, v_i, c_i)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是字段值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是置信度。难点全在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的定义和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的用法上。工程上必须先把四个量钉死：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>字段模式（schema）</strong>：哪些字段必须有、类型是什么、是否可空。发票的 <code>invoice_number</code> 是字符串，<code>total_amount</code> 是带币种的金额值，<code>due_date</code> 是日期——当字符串存，下游对账就会在 <code>01/02/2026</code> 是 1 月 2 日还是 2 月 1 日上翻车。</li>\n<li><strong>键值对（KVP）</strong>：一个 key 文本（<code>Invoice No.</code>）与一个 value 文本（<code>INV-2026-04417</code>）的关联。<strong>关联本身就是难点</strong>——票据里 key 和 value 常常不同行、不同基线，中间隔着点线填充符。</li>\n<li><strong>字段级指标</strong>：不是文档级的「对了/错了」，而是逐字段的 precision/recall/F1。FUNSD 基准（199 份表单、9,707 个语义实体、5,304 条关系）就是为这个口径设计的，见 <a href=\"https://guillaumejaume.github.io/FUNSD/\">guillaumejaume.github.io/FUNSD</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>直通率（STP）</strong>：无需人工介入即入账的单据占比。这是运营指标而非模型指标，由模型精度<strong>和</strong>分流策略共同决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F1_{field} = \\frac{2 \\cdot P_{field} \\cdot R_{field}}{P_{field} + R_{field}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>字段级 F1 与文档级准确率不可互换。</strong> 一张发票有 12 个字段，若每个字段都 95% 正确，整单全对概率只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.95</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>54</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.95^{12}\\approx 54\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54%</span></span></span></span></span>。这解释了「模型 95% 准」听起来不错，落地后 STP 却常常只有一半。</p>\n<h2 id=\"票据场景对照-字段模式因单据类型而变\">票据场景对照：字段模式因单据类型而变</h2><p>不同票据的字段模式与背后规范完全不同，这决定了你<strong>不能用一个通用模型套所有票据</strong>，必须按单据类型分别建 schema 与评测集：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单据类型</th>\n<th>关键字段（示例）</th>\n<th>结构特点</th>\n<th>相关规范/来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商业发票</td>\n<td>发票号、开票日、币种、净额/税额/总额、买卖双方 VAT 号</td>\n<td>键值在页首，行项目在表体</td>\n<td>EN 16931 语义模型 / Peppol BIS Billing 3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报关单</td>\n<td>报关单号、HS 编码、成交方式、件数、毛净重、原产国</td>\n<td>大量无边框键值网格</td>\n<td>各国海关申报规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提单/运单</td>\n<td>提单号、船名航次、装卸货港、集装箱号、封志号</td>\n<td>多联复写、字段跨页</td>\n<td>国际货运惯例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行付款水单</td>\n<td>交易流水号、收付款账号、金额、SWIFT 域</td>\n<td>金额与账号易混淆</td>\n<td>ISO 20022 域定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收据/小票</td>\n<td>商户、日期、合计、税</td>\n<td>热敏打印、低质扫描</td>\n<td>SROIE / CORD 基准口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>字段模式要区分<strong>内部约定</strong>与<strong>外部标准</strong>。欧盟侧 B2B 发票已由 EN 16931 语义模型约束，Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 是它的一个 CIUS；抽取字段若与 EN 16931 术语对不齐，后续电子发票对接几乎一定返工。因此<strong>先对齐标准字段名，再谈模型</strong>，是票据 KIE 最省钱的一条顺序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[票据图像] --&gt; B{单据分类器}&#10;    B --&gt;|发票| C[发票 schema&lt;br/&gt;EN 16931 对齐]&#10;    B --&gt;|报关单| D[报关 schema]&#10;    B --&gt;|提单| E[运单 schema]&#10;    B --&gt;|收据| F[收据 schema]&#10;    C --&gt; G[表头字段: KIE 键值抽取]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; H[表体行项目: TSR 表格抽取]&#10;    G --&gt; I[字段值 + 置信度]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J{置信度分流}&#10;    J --&gt;|高| K[直通入账 STP]&#10;    J --&gt;|低| L[人工复核工单]\">flowchart TD\n    A[票据图像] --&gt; B{单据分类器}\n    B --&gt;|发票| C[发票 schema&lt;br/&gt;EN 16931 对齐]\n    B --&gt;|报关单| D[报关 schema]\n    B --&gt;|提单| E[运单 schema]\n    B --&gt;|收据| F[收据 schema]\n    C --&gt; G[表头字段: KIE 键值抽取]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; H[表体行项目: TSR 表格抽取]\n    G --&gt; I[字段值 + 置信度]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J{置信度分流}\n    J --&gt;|高| K[直通入账 STP]\n    J --&gt;|低| L[人工复核工单]</pre><h2 id=\"技术路线-从版面感知模型到文档大模型\">技术路线：从版面感知模型到文档大模型</h2><p>KIE 的主流实现有三代，工程上常做分层兜底而非单选：</p>\n<p>第一代是<strong>模板/规则法</strong>——用锚点文本（<code>Total</code>、<code>Invoice No.</code>）定位，再按几何邻域取最近文本块作为 value。它快、可解释、零训练，但对版式漂移极度脆弱，且无法处理 key 缺失或多值歧义。</p>\n<p>第二代是<strong>版面感知预训练模型</strong>——把文本、坐标、图像三模态一起编码，其 token 同时带文本嵌入、二维位置嵌入与视觉嵌入，输出每个 token 的实体标签再聚合成字段值。这类模型的输入正是上游版面分析产出的区域框与阅读顺序。云厂商的通用抽取 API 属于这一代：Azure AI Document Intelligence 的预置发票/收据模型、AWS Textract 的 <code>AnalyzeExpense</code>、Google Document AI 的 Invoice Parser 都为每个字段返回 0–1 的置信度（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/document-intelligence/\">Microsoft Learn</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/textract/latest/dg/analyzing-document-expense.html\">AWS Textract</a>）。</p>\n<p>第三代是<strong>文档大模型 / VLM 端到端抽取</strong>——给模型图像 + 字段模式的自然语言描述，直接返回 JSON。它免标注、跨版式泛化强，但带来两个新问题：<strong>幻觉</strong>（字段在票面上不存在却编出一个值）与<strong>不可审计</strong>（给不出这个值来自页面哪个区域）。解法是把 VLM 限定在「已定位区域」内做归一化，而不是让它对着整页自由生成。</p>\n<p>一个务实的路由：<strong>规则法做锚点兜底 → 版面感知模型做主抽取 → VLM 只处理前两者都低置信度的长尾版式</strong>。Rossum 的 DocILE 基准（6,500 份真实单据、11 万余行项目与十万级键值对，<a href=\"https://docile.rossum.ai/\">docile.rossum.ai</a>）在真实业务文档上评测后仍显示字段与行项目抽取是两个独立难点，说明「一个模型吃所有票据」在 2026 年并不成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人工复核闭环-置信度阈值与成本最优分流\">人工复核闭环：置信度阈值与成本最优分流</h2><p><strong>置信度如果只用来展示，就等于没做。</strong> 它唯一的工程价值是驱动分流：高于阈值直接入账，低于阈值进复核队列。阈值不是拍脑袋定的，而由两类错误的成本比决定。设复核一份单据的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，放行一个错误字段的代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>err</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>vs.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{cost} \\mid c] = P(\\text{err} \\mid c)\\cdot C_{err} \\quad \\text{vs.} \\quad C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vs.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>err</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{err}\\mid c)\\cdot C_{err} &gt; C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就应当送复核。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>err</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{err}\\mid c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 单调下降，这条判据等价于一个<strong>阈值</strong>。关键在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因字段而异：金额字段错一位可能触发付款错误，成本极高；<code>remarks</code> 这类自由文本错了几乎无代价。因此<strong>阈值应当是字段级的，不是文档级的</strong>——统一阈值会把备注字段也送进复核队列，白白拉低 STP。</p>\n<p>置信度的**校准（calibration）**比它的大小更重要。如果模型说「0.9」实际只有 70% 正确，阈值就失去意义。工程上要定期用留出集画可靠性曲线（reliability diagram），必要时做温度缩放（temperature scaling）把输出概率压到真实频率。<strong>未经校准的置信度分流，STP 与错误率都无法预测。</strong></p>\n<p>复核界面同样影响总成本。有效的工单应：每个字段高亮其在原图上的<strong>来源区域</strong>（否则复核员要通读整页）、按置信度升序排列、把候选值做成<strong>可一键接受的下拉</strong>。已高亮的低置信度字段通常几秒可处理，通读整页再录入要数十秒。复核结果还必须<strong>回流</strong>成训练数据，形成「抽取 → 复核 → 标注 → 再训练」的闭环；只复核不回流，等于每次都在重复纠正同一类错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规约束-三条会反向改动字段设计的红线\">合规约束：三条会反向改动字段设计的红线</h2><p>票据里几乎必然包含个人信息（姓名、账号、地址、税号），因此 KIE 不是纯技术系统，几条合规约束会直接改动字段与存储设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n<th>对字段/流程的实际要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据最小化</td>\n<td>GDPR 第 5(1)(c) 条</td>\n<td>只抽业务需要的字段，禁止「先全抽后筛」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化决策</td>\n<td>GDPR 第 22 条</td>\n<td>对个人产生法律/重大影响的纯自动决定需人工介入与解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高风险清单</td>\n<td>欧盟 AI Act（Regulation (EU) 2024/1689）</td>\n<td>用于自然人信用评估等场景的自动化属高风险，需留存与人工监督</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化决策（中国）</td>\n<td>个人信息保护法第 24 条</td>\n<td>自动化决策需透明、公平，并提供不针对个人的选项或便捷拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化电子发票</td>\n<td>EN 16931 / Peppol BIS Billing 3.0</td>\n<td>字段命名与语义必须对齐标准，否则无法对接电子发票体系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>GDPR 第 22 条与 AI Act 的组合，是「人工复核」从体验问题变成合规问题的原因。</strong> 若一张票据的抽取结果会直接触发对某个自然人的付款、拒付或信用判定，「模型不确定时人工复核」就不再只是降本手段，而是合规上必需的环节——复核必须真实生效且可审计。这解释了复核工单为何要留存决策记录：谁在何时接受了哪个候选值、原始置信度是多少。反过来说，<strong>备注类与人无直接利害关系的字段不进复核队列，是合规允许的优化</strong>。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧的电子发票时间线也在压缩「非结构化抽取」的适用空间。德国自 2025 年 1 月 1 日起要求境内 B2B 交易双方具备接收结构化电子发票（XRechnung 或 ZUGFeRD 2.3+，均基于 EN 16931）的能力；ViDA（VAT in the Digital Age）方案在 2025 年 3 月经 ECOFIN 达成一致，把跨境数字申报推向 2030 年（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/\">欧盟税收与海关总署</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/billing/3.0/\">Peppol BIS Billing 3.0</a>）。这意味着<strong>结构化发票会逐步进入主链路，但图像 KIE 不会消失</strong>——历史归档、纸质采购、非电子化跨境单据仍要抽出结构化字段，只是定位从「主路径」退到「补齐路径」。</p>\n<p>一条由此推出的设计原则：<strong>当票据已有合规的结构化来源时（如 Peppol 报文、全面数字化电子发票的票面 XML），优先解析结构化数据，只在缺失时才回退到图像 KIE。</strong> 图像抽取是兜底能力，不是默认起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>KIE 的评测单位是<strong>字段</strong>，不是文档。「12 个字段各 95% 正确」= 整单全对仅约 54%，这个乘法关系是 STP 上不去的根因。</li>\n<li>字段模式要先对齐外部标准（EN 16931 / Peppol），再谈模型；字段名对不齐，电子发票对接必然返工。</li>\n<li>技术路线分层兜底：规则锚点 → 版面感知模型主抽取 → VLM 处理长尾；别让 VLM 对整页自由生成。</li>\n<li>置信度只有<strong>驱动分流</strong>才有价值，且必须<strong>校准</strong>；阈值应<strong>字段级</strong>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{err}/C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推出；复核闭环要回流成训练数据。</li>\n<li>GDPR 第 22 条、PIPL 第 24 条与欧盟 AI Act 让「人工复核」在涉及自然人的场景下成为合规要求，复核记录必须可审计留存。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表单与键值抽取实操：票据场景、人工复核与合规约束","id":"表单与键值抽取实操-票据场景-人工复核与合规约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：KV 抽取的任务形式与四个量","id":"核心概念-kv-抽取的任务形式与四个量"},{"level":2,"text":"票据场景对照：字段模式因单据类型而变","id":"票据场景对照-字段模式因单据类型而变"},{"level":2,"text":"技术路线：从版面感知模型到文档大模型","id":"技术路线-从版面感知模型到文档大模型"},{"level":2,"text":"人工复核闭环：置信度阈值与成本最优分流","id":"人工复核闭环-置信度阈值与成本最优分流"},{"level":2,"text":"合规约束：三条会反向改动字段设计的红线","id":"合规约束-三条会反向改动字段设计的红线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表格结构识别与抽取：单元格还原、跨行列合并与有线无线表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/layout-table-form-extraction/table-structure-recognition-extraction"},"next":{"title":"文档大模型：多模态理解范式、能力边界与提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/document-vlm-rag-eval-operations/document-vlm-multimodal-understanding"}}